WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 18

01:41.730 --> 01:43.600
But I'm willing to marry him.

01:45.300 --> 01:46.620
You're deceived by

01:46.620 --> 01:48.490
the sweet words of that brat.

01:49.050 --> 01:50.630
He really has a glib tongue

01:50.650 --> 01:52.920
and doesn't behave seriously sometimes,

01:52.940 --> 01:55.160
but the expression in his eyes is really pure.

01:55.180 --> 01:56.200
Second brother,

01:56.220 --> 01:57.330
I don't know what has happened

01:57.330 --> 01:58.990
between you two,

01:59.010 --> 02:00.600
but he is definitely not a flibbertigibbet.

02:00.620 --> 02:01.300
What kind of man he is

02:01.300 --> 02:02.730
doesn't matter now.

02:03.050 --> 02:04.280
Maybe he is a good man,

02:04.300 --> 02:05.050
or maybe as you say,

02:05.050 --> 02:05.710
he is sincere.

02:05.730 --> 02:06.670
But he isn't supposed to come to the capital city.

02:06.690 --> 02:08.200
Many people have been staring at him.

02:09.780 --> 02:11.170
What do you mean?

02:15.820 --> 02:19.370
Wan'er, our family owes you a lot.

02:19.900 --> 02:21.530
Sometimes,

02:21.780 --> 02:22.650
I don't really know

02:22.650 --> 02:24.840
how I can make it up to you.

02:29.260 --> 02:31.710
Second brother, you've always been kind to me.

02:31.730 --> 02:33.370
I know that in my heart.

02:33.420 --> 02:35.000
Dad seldom comes to see you

02:35.490 --> 02:39.090
for the sake of the overall situation and our family.

02:42.180 --> 02:43.430
I understand.

02:43.450 --> 02:45.350
But sometimes I couldn't help wondering.

02:45.370 --> 02:47.890
If we can't protect our family members,

02:48.980 --> 02:51.120
what's the meaning of maintaining the glory of our family?

02:52.060 --> 02:53.810
I don't allow you to marry him

02:54.540 --> 02:56.610
for fear that he might get you into trouble.

02:57.490 --> 02:59.330
I just want to protect you.

03:07.010 --> 03:08.810
I'll leave this to you.

03:10.820 --> 03:12.530
Don't let him see you ever again.

04:09.540 --> 04:10.690
Brother.

04:20.930 --> 04:23.560
Lin Gong is the one who wants to kill me.

04:23.580 --> 04:26.290
The Second Young Master? Why?

04:28.090 --> 04:29.920
Is he a follower of the Crown Prince,

04:31.210 --> 04:33.090
or is it about the financial power of the Neiku?

04:35.770 --> 04:37.850
Nobody has ever asked me!

04:38.260 --> 04:40.720
Nobody! Never!

04:41.740 --> 04:43.170
They just want the financial power of the Neiku, right?

04:43.170 --> 04:44.370
I'll give it to them.

04:44.370 --> 04:46.290
I never want it myself.

04:49.210 --> 04:50.770
They can just ask,

04:50.770 --> 04:52.250
but they actually chose to kill people!

04:53.580 --> 04:54.840
Why did you

04:54.860 --> 04:55.420
make a fuss

04:55.420 --> 04:57.090
at the imperial residence just now?

04:57.820 --> 04:59.680
I broke into the imperial residence

04:59.700 --> 05:01.720
to offer him a chance to kill me.

05:01.740 --> 05:03.190
I've noticed that his subordinates

05:03.210 --> 05:04.930
are all martial arts masters of and above the Seventh Dan.

05:04.930 --> 05:05.580
They are strong enough

05:05.580 --> 05:07.290
to capture Cheng Jushu.

05:07.370 --> 05:08.870
Later, I visited Ye Ling'er.

05:08.890 --> 05:10.130
From her,

05:10.930 --> 05:13.480
I confirmed that Lin Gong is the real killer.

05:13.820 --> 05:16.970
So Lin Gong follows the Crown Prince?

05:19.490 --> 05:21.400
Now, I have no evidence to prove that

05:21.420 --> 05:23.530
the Crown Prince is involved.

05:24.860 --> 05:26.850
So for now,

05:27.020 --> 05:28.720
Lin Gong is my only revenge target.

05:29.820 --> 05:31.440
When will you take a move?

05:32.460 --> 05:34.590
Quick-tempered as I am, I can hardly wait.

05:34.610 --> 05:35.840
I'll kill him tonight.

05:35.860 --> 05:36.580
Didn't you just say that

05:36.580 --> 05:37.720
he's surrounded by martial arts masters?

05:37.740 --> 05:39.010
I still have to go!

05:39.090 --> 05:40.490
Only to avenge Teng Zijing's death?

05:40.490 --> 05:42.120
I do it for Teng Zijing,

05:42.140 --> 05:42.890
but not only

05:42.890 --> 05:44.570
for him.

05:49.050 --> 05:50.410
Who else?

05:52.300 --> 05:53.690
Ruoruo, look!

05:56.090 --> 05:57.440
Most people in the world

05:57.460 --> 05:59.370
are ordinary, just like them.

05:59.490 --> 06:00.930
But there're always some theories,

06:00.930 --> 06:02.400
some big potatoes

06:02.420 --> 06:04.250
that regard them as insignificant.

06:07.020 --> 06:08.960
He's dead, but he's just a guard.

06:08.980 --> 06:11.530
I've heard that so many times.

06:13.260 --> 06:16.440
Ruoruo, I enjoy crowds.

06:17.770 --> 06:19.960
I think that without the ordinary people,

06:19.980 --> 06:21.570
Nanqing won't exist.

06:22.140 --> 06:23.810
Nor will the world.

06:26.930 --> 06:28.530
Pick me something fat.

06:28.700 --> 06:30.320
Look at this. And this.

06:31.020 --> 06:33.040
I made it! I made it!

06:34.050 --> 06:35.800
So I want to fight

06:35.820 --> 06:38.280
with the hows and whys in the world

06:38.300 --> 06:40.320
and tell those big potatoes that

06:40.580 --> 06:42.640
ordinary people are important.

06:44.330 --> 06:45.640
Brother,

06:46.490 --> 06:48.040
you only think about them.

06:49.090 --> 06:50.760
Why don't you think about yourself?

06:53.930 --> 06:55.400
About what?

06:55.420 --> 06:57.630
Lin Gong is the elder brother of Lin Wan'er,

06:57.650 --> 06:59.250
just like us.

06:59.330 --> 07:00.140
If someday,

07:00.140 --> 07:01.880
Lin Wan'er kills me,

07:03.140 --> 07:05.040
will you still marry her?

07:10.050 --> 07:11.630
I know you want to revenge.

07:11.650 --> 07:12.720
You refuse to accept what has happened.

07:12.740 --> 07:15.150
I understand it all, so I won't stop you.

07:15.170 --> 07:17.530
But you must understand that

07:18.170 --> 07:20.530
if you kill Lin Gong yourself,

07:20.860 --> 07:22.130
there will be no future

07:23.370 --> 07:25.440
for Wan'er and you.

07:26.700 --> 07:28.520
Then shall I give up

07:28.540 --> 07:30.370
and let Teng Zijing die in vain?

07:33.770 --> 07:35.810
I don't know, either.

07:36.820 --> 07:38.640
But you can't have both.

07:39.540 --> 07:41.480
I know it's hard.

07:42.210 --> 07:43.850
But brother,

07:45.540 --> 07:47.880
you must make the choice yourself.

07:51.300 --> 07:53.030
Ruoruo, please go back first.

07:53.050 --> 07:54.570
I want to be alone.

08:48.730 --> 08:49.490
Did your second brother really

08:49.490 --> 08:51.030
try to kill Fan Xian

08:51.050 --> 08:52.720
this afternoon?

08:53.780 --> 08:56.270
He hates Fan Xian so much that

08:56.290 --> 08:58.010
he can't be persuaded.

09:00.660 --> 09:02.450
He values you deeply.

09:02.930 --> 09:04.930
But he saw Fan Xian sneaking into your room

09:04.930 --> 09:07.080
without considering your reputation.

09:07.370 --> 09:08.680
It's understandable that

09:08.700 --> 09:10.400
he went mad.

09:11.140 --> 09:13.400
But I just feel that

09:13.610 --> 09:15.880
something has happened

09:15.900 --> 09:18.040
between Fan Xian and him.

09:23.370 --> 09:26.050
If there are

09:26.050 --> 09:28.250
some insoluble contradictions

09:28.340 --> 09:29.080
between your family member

09:29.100 --> 09:30.770
and the man you love.

09:32.050 --> 09:33.720
Who will you choose?

09:35.700 --> 09:36.780
I...

09:39.220 --> 09:40.770
I don't know.

09:41.970 --> 09:43.640
As an illegitimate daughter,

09:43.660 --> 09:46.040
I should avoid seeing my father and mother,

09:46.290 --> 09:48.720
nor should I expect any family affection.

09:49.410 --> 09:51.010
But in these years,

09:51.260 --> 09:53.480
my second brother Lin Gong is
the only one who treats me nicely.

09:54.730 --> 09:55.530
Whenever he saw

09:55.530 --> 09:56.800
something fresh and interesting,

09:56.820 --> 09:58.350
he would bring it to me,

09:58.370 --> 09:59.050
for fear that I might feel bored

09:59.050 --> 10:01.010
in the room.

10:01.460 --> 10:03.650
He makes me feel warm.

10:04.660 --> 10:06.720
He's really kind to me.

10:08.100 --> 10:09.520
But as to Fan Xian,

10:13.970 --> 10:15.520
I originally thought

10:15.610 --> 10:17.320
I would marry someone I don't love,

10:17.340 --> 10:19.720
and we would respect each other like guests.

10:20.100 --> 10:22.000
But unexpectedly,

10:22.020 --> 10:23.410
I actually met him

10:23.410 --> 10:25.370
by fate.

10:26.780 --> 10:28.330
In my heart,

10:30.170 --> 10:32.130
he's the right man for me.

10:32.730 --> 10:34.400
So emotionally,

10:34.730 --> 10:36.960
I will take no side.

10:37.700 --> 10:39.570
If one of them

10:40.580 --> 10:43.040
really made a mistake...

10:43.820 --> 10:45.450
Who will you choose?

10:49.490 --> 10:51.040
I only hope that

10:52.340 --> 10:54.450
there is justice in the world.

11:20.660 --> 11:21.810
Brother,

11:22.970 --> 11:24.640
I know you want to revenge.

11:24.660 --> 11:25.780
You refuse to accept what has happened.

11:25.780 --> 11:28.350
I understand it all, so I won't stop you.

11:28.370 --> 11:30.320
But you must understand that

11:30.340 --> 11:32.240
if you kill Lin Gong yourself,

11:32.260 --> 11:33.890
there will be no future

11:34.220 --> 11:36.480
for Wan'er and you.

11:41.880 --> 11:43.430
=Wuzhu, servant of Fan Xian's late mother=

11:46.050 --> 11:47.650
Uncle Wuzhu.

11:48.730 --> 11:50.010
Go back.

11:50.100 --> 11:52.280
Lin Gong planned the assassination on the Niulan Street.

11:52.370 --> 11:54.390
Teng Zijing died a grim death because of me.

11:54.410 --> 11:55.350
I know.

11:55.370 --> 11:57.130
I want to kill him.

11:58.290 --> 11:59.200
You're hesitant.

11:59.220 --> 12:00.440
I'm not.

12:00.460 --> 12:01.470
I'm the one that he wants to kill!

12:01.490 --> 12:02.910
Teng Zijing died for me!

12:02.930 --> 12:04.080
I have to kill him.

12:04.100 --> 12:06.030
You're utterly confused!

12:06.050 --> 12:08.880
If you go now, you'll get yourself killed.

12:08.900 --> 12:11.390
Uncle, step aside.

12:11.410 --> 12:12.320
Go back.

12:12.340 --> 12:13.490
So do you also think that

12:13.490 --> 12:14.370
Teng Zijing's death

12:14.370 --> 12:15.910
means nothing?

12:15.930 --> 12:17.080
Yes.

12:27.050 --> 12:28.840
Then so be it!

13:11.260 --> 13:12.890
You've made some progress,

13:17.780 --> 13:19.720
but you still lack patience.

13:57.220 --> 13:58.400
Uncle Wuzhu?

14:02.530 --> 14:03.840
Uncle Wuzhu?

14:06.100 --> 14:07.330
Uncle Wuzhu?

14:10.290 --> 14:11.270
Brother, what's up?

14:11.290 --> 14:12.560
Where's Uncle Wuzhu?

14:12.580 --> 14:13.950
Uncle Wuzhu?

14:13.970 --> 14:15.690
The man who helped you in Danzhou?

14:15.730 --> 14:17.370
I haven't seen him.

14:17.900 --> 14:19.570
Why am I home?

14:19.700 --> 14:21.130
What's the matter?

14:31.900 --> 14:32.530
Brother, where are you going?

14:32.530 --> 14:33.290
To kill Lin Gong.

14:33.290 --> 14:34.450
He's left.

14:38.020 --> 14:38.830
This morning,

14:38.850 --> 14:40.680
Lin Gong left the city in a hurry.

14:40.700 --> 14:41.590
How do you know that?

14:41.610 --> 14:43.080
Ye Ling'er from the Ye mansion came to see you.

14:43.100 --> 14:44.520
She brought the news.

14:44.900 --> 14:46.350
Where does Lin Gong go?

14:46.370 --> 14:47.920
She didn't mention that.

15:10.460 --> 15:11.910
Kill him.

15:11.930 --> 15:14.210
No one can see my face.

15:18.410 --> 15:19.470
What are you doing?

15:19.490 --> 15:20.440
What are you doing?

15:20.460 --> 15:22.480
Wait! My sheep!

15:36.340 --> 15:37.320
Has Lin Gong left?

15:37.340 --> 15:38.240
Yes.

15:38.260 --> 15:39.460
He left the city with many guards.

15:39.460 --> 15:40.950
Do you know where he is heading for?

15:40.970 --> 15:41.950
I don't know.

15:41.970 --> 15:42.910
But I know that

15:42.930 --> 15:44.830
he visited the Crown Prince before leaving.

15:44.850 --> 15:45.830
Then he went back to the Lin mansion.

15:45.850 --> 15:46.780
After a few minutes,

15:46.780 --> 15:48.470
he got on a carriage and left in a hurry.

15:48.490 --> 15:49.290
So the Crown Prince

15:49.290 --> 15:50.840
is also involved.

15:53.580 --> 15:55.130
How do you know it so clearly?

15:55.700 --> 15:57.640
I visited Wan'er

15:57.660 --> 15:58.830
and talked with her yesterday.

15:58.850 --> 15:59.830
What did you tell her?

15:59.850 --> 16:00.710
Don't worry.

16:00.730 --> 16:01.530
I said nothing

16:01.530 --> 16:02.810
about Lin Gong.

16:03.460 --> 16:05.080
I just come around myself.

16:05.100 --> 16:06.370
Will you inform the Investigator's Office of

16:06.410 --> 16:07.530
his collusion with the enemies

16:07.530 --> 16:08.580
and testify against him?

16:08.580 --> 16:09.810
No way!

16:10.410 --> 16:12.000
The Crown Prince is involved after all,

16:12.020 --> 16:13.460
I can't drag my family into this.

16:13.460 --> 16:14.490
Then there's no way out.

16:14.490 --> 16:16.020
Si Lili's testimony alone

16:16.020 --> 16:17.400
won't be able to prove Lin Gong guilty.

16:18.530 --> 16:19.170
Though I can't

16:19.170 --> 16:20.890
put my family at risk,

16:21.220 --> 16:22.100
I won't just

16:22.100 --> 16:22.660
watch Beiqi harm Nanqing

16:22.660 --> 16:24.000
and do nothing.

16:24.020 --> 16:25.680
Since you can catch Si Lili,

16:25.700 --> 16:26.410
you must be able to

16:26.410 --> 16:28.210
find Lin Gong.

16:28.290 --> 16:30.030
I hope you can find him back

16:30.050 --> 16:31.720
and figure out the whole thing.

16:31.970 --> 16:34.690
If he really colluded with the
enemies and betrayed our country,

16:36.900 --> 16:38.890
His Majesty will punish him.

16:39.900 --> 16:41.210
Thanks for your information.

16:42.930 --> 16:44.660
But he's gone already. How can we catch him?

16:44.660 --> 16:45.760
I know a guy

16:45.780 --> 16:46.960
who's good at hunting people.

17:35.580 --> 17:38.650
This yard is secluded.

17:39.700 --> 17:40.960
Let's sleep here tonight.

17:40.980 --> 17:42.750
Tomorrow, we'll find a boat and go south.

17:42.770 --> 17:43.600
Yes.

17:43.620 --> 17:44.390
Second Young Master,

17:44.410 --> 17:45.580
where are we going

17:45.580 --> 17:47.530
exactly?

17:49.820 --> 17:51.410
Nowhere specific.

17:51.700 --> 17:53.720
After all, I only have to hide for now.

17:53.930 --> 17:55.170
Second Young Master,

17:55.290 --> 17:57.220
what do you have to hide from

17:57.220 --> 17:59.250
in the capital city?

18:11.820 --> 18:14.030
We must start from the Prime Minister's mansion.

18:14.050 --> 18:15.480
The impresses of carriages are different.

18:15.500 --> 18:16.870
Only by searching from the start

18:16.890 --> 18:18.650
can we find a trace.

18:19.980 --> 18:21.200
I've been thinking recently.

18:21.220 --> 18:23.110
You might have flaws,

18:23.130 --> 18:24.630
but capable as you are,

18:24.650 --> 18:26.840
how come you're just a clerk?

18:26.930 --> 18:28.800
I just seek ease and comfort.

18:28.820 --> 18:30.930
Then you should never follow me.

18:31.250 --> 18:31.960
In these days,

18:31.980 --> 18:32.530
what I did

18:32.530 --> 18:34.270
is extremely dangerous.

18:34.290 --> 18:37.130
Your Excellency, you're generous after all.

18:37.410 --> 18:39.170
Don't mention the money.

18:39.410 --> 18:40.840
It's only an excuse.

18:40.860 --> 18:41.960
We both know that

18:41.980 --> 18:44.440
you follow me for some other reasons.

18:45.290 --> 18:47.440
The Prime Minister's mansion is right ahead.

18:47.980 --> 18:50.320
I won't ask if you don't want to say.

18:56.460 --> 18:57.840
I've met you.

19:01.700 --> 19:04.010
You're the subordinate of Chengze.

19:04.930 --> 19:06.510
Distinguished as His Highness is,

19:06.530 --> 19:07.530
how dare you call him like that!

19:07.530 --> 19:09.320
I won't next time. See you.

19:09.860 --> 19:11.200
His Highness wants to see you.

19:11.740 --> 19:13.360
I have something urgent to deal with.

19:13.380 --> 19:14.960
I'll ask for his forgiveness in person some other day.

19:16.170 --> 19:17.770
His Highness is nearby.

19:18.930 --> 19:20.800
After sitting on the carriage for so long,

19:20.980 --> 19:23.050
it feels good to walk around.

19:23.770 --> 19:25.150
By the way,

19:25.170 --> 19:27.680
I'll think about our route to the south.

19:28.580 --> 19:30.170
Since we're leaving the capital city,

19:30.290 --> 19:32.290
we can visit some people.

19:32.410 --> 19:33.200
Second Young Master,

19:33.220 --> 19:35.010
a blind man at the door wants to see you.

19:35.380 --> 19:36.530
A blind man?

19:36.580 --> 19:37.870
Can he practice martial arts?

19:37.890 --> 19:39.800
He doesn't have any vitality qi.

19:40.740 --> 19:42.080
Let him in.

19:42.860 --> 19:44.890
Everyone, watch out! Prepare to attack at any time!

19:55.290 --> 19:56.770
Go by yourself.

19:58.500 --> 19:59.890
Your Excellency, please go ahead.

20:09.820 --> 20:11.250
Though I've read the Red Mansions for several times,

20:11.250 --> 20:13.460
I'm still fond of reading it.

20:13.460 --> 20:15.250
Have you read it?

20:16.460 --> 20:18.170
Why are you reading here?

20:18.380 --> 20:20.080
Cross ventilation

20:20.100 --> 20:20.770
makes it shady and cool here.

20:20.770 --> 20:22.960
It's really a good place for reading at noon.

20:23.340 --> 20:24.410
The beauty of the capital city

20:24.410 --> 20:26.220
lies not in various mansions,

20:26.220 --> 20:28.080
but in streets and alleys.

20:28.100 --> 20:29.440
It does have a distinctive flavor.

20:29.460 --> 20:31.410
Your Highness, do you think I'm silly?

20:33.530 --> 20:34.480
Why do you say so?

20:34.500 --> 20:35.460
Your Highness, you find a place

20:35.460 --> 20:36.630
to enjoy the cool and read the book when you're free.

20:36.650 --> 20:38.150
And I happen to be around.

20:38.170 --> 20:38.890
How silly am I

20:38.890 --> 20:40.440
to believe this crap?

20:44.010 --> 20:45.720
You're right.

20:46.380 --> 20:48.370
I'm actually waiting for you.

20:49.290 --> 20:50.960
Are you looking for Lin Gong?

20:50.980 --> 20:52.270
How do you know?

20:52.290 --> 20:53.270
This morning,

20:53.290 --> 20:55.890
Lin Gong and the Crown Prince met at the Eastern Palace

20:56.170 --> 20:57.800
and had a quarrel.

20:57.820 --> 20:58.930
Your name was heard vaguely

20:58.930 --> 21:00.840
outside the study.

21:00.860 --> 21:03.080
Then Lin Gong left the capital in a hurry.

21:03.170 --> 21:04.530
So I wait for you near the Prime Minister's mansion.

21:04.530 --> 21:06.320
And you really show up.

21:06.820 --> 21:07.980
Your Highness, how can you know

21:07.980 --> 21:09.440
what happened in the Eastern Palace?

21:10.010 --> 21:12.230
I sure have spies there.

21:12.250 --> 21:14.440
Is it appropriate to tell me that?

21:14.500 --> 21:15.100
It doesn't matter.

21:15.100 --> 21:16.510
It's not a secret.

21:16.530 --> 21:18.800
I've also got spies from the Crown Prince around me.

21:18.930 --> 21:20.230
How loving and touching

21:20.250 --> 21:21.800
you are!

21:23.220 --> 21:24.620
No one but you

21:24.620 --> 21:26.410
has ever talked to me like that.

21:27.220 --> 21:28.480
Your Highness, are you waiting for me here

21:28.500 --> 21:30.080
to tell me that?

21:30.500 --> 21:31.440
I'm asking you,

21:31.460 --> 21:32.750
are you looking for Lin Gong?

21:32.770 --> 21:33.870
Yes.

21:33.890 --> 21:34.820
I won't ask you why.

21:34.820 --> 21:35.500
I only ask you,

21:35.500 --> 21:36.460
will there be a fight?

21:36.460 --> 21:36.860
Yes.

21:36.860 --> 21:38.340
This morning, Lin Gong left

21:38.340 --> 21:39.130
with many guards.

21:39.130 --> 21:39.960
They are all martial arts masters.

21:39.980 --> 21:40.630
Do you know that?

21:40.650 --> 21:41.910
I know. They are masters of or above the Seventh Dan.

21:41.930 --> 21:42.530
Can you defeat them?

21:42.530 --> 21:43.720
Not really.

21:47.220 --> 21:48.220
Xie Bi'an is known as

21:48.220 --> 21:49.870
"Faster than Light."

21:49.890 --> 21:50.890
He is the best swordsman

21:50.890 --> 21:53.360
in the capital city.

21:53.380 --> 21:55.150
Faster than light?

21:55.170 --> 21:56.080
Fast sword.
('fast sword' is a homophone for 'express' in Chinese)

21:56.100 --> 21:57.770
I know S.F. Express for being fast.

22:00.650 --> 22:01.500
You actually

22:01.500 --> 22:02.960
understand swordsmanship!

22:03.820 --> 22:04.910
To attack fast,

22:04.930 --> 22:06.800
besides a flexible figure,

22:06.820 --> 22:09.010
you must borrow the power of nature.

22:09.100 --> 22:11.890
Attacking with the wind will sure make a difference.
('with the wind' is a homophone for 'S.F. Express' in Chinese)

22:12.460 --> 22:14.840
Unbelievable!

22:16.620 --> 22:18.080
With Xie Bi'an by your side,

22:18.100 --> 22:19.480
you might stand a chance.

22:23.290 --> 22:25.010
Your Highness, why do you help me?

22:26.130 --> 22:27.480
I appreciate your talents.

22:27.500 --> 22:29.460
Also, if you marry Wan'er,

22:29.460 --> 22:30.530
you'll take over the Neiku.

22:30.530 --> 22:31.290
I'm friendly with you

22:31.290 --> 22:33.410
for the sake of the properties.

22:34.130 --> 22:35.460
I really appreciate

22:35.460 --> 22:36.630
your frankness.

22:36.650 --> 22:37.800
But this time,

22:38.500 --> 22:40.930
no need to bother Mr. Xie.

22:42.170 --> 22:43.840
Then be careful yourself.

22:45.250 --> 22:46.440
Your Highness, aren't you angry?

22:46.460 --> 22:47.820
It's perfectly justifiable to choose the Crown Prince.

22:47.820 --> 22:49.320
It makes sense that you don't choose me.

22:49.340 --> 22:50.770
Why should I be angry?

22:51.010 --> 22:52.030
Compared to the Crown Prince,

22:52.050 --> 22:53.410
I think Your Highness stand a better chance.

22:55.890 --> 22:56.990
If you have time, we can meet more often.

22:57.010 --> 22:59.440
We won't talk about national affairs, but romance.

23:20.290 --> 23:21.510
Who are you?

23:21.530 --> 23:22.680
How do you find me?

23:22.700 --> 23:23.630
Lin Gong.

23:23.650 --> 23:24.480
How dare you!

23:24.500 --> 23:25.340
How can you call the Second Young Master

23:25.340 --> 23:26.480
by his name?

23:26.500 --> 23:28.200
Everything is related.

23:28.220 --> 23:31.600
You want to kill Fan Xian, so I will kill you.

23:35.410 --> 23:36.270
Kill him!

23:36.290 --> 23:37.460
Second Young Master,

23:37.460 --> 23:38.600
shall we ask who sent him?

23:38.620 --> 23:39.840
After killing him,

23:39.860 --> 23:41.960
the man behind him is sure to show up.

23:54.500 --> 23:55.840
Bury him.

24:06.890 --> 24:08.800
Actually, I only want to kill you.

24:08.820 --> 24:10.080
Kill him!

25:36.580 --> 25:38.530
I'm the son of the Prime Minster

25:38.530 --> 25:39.870
and the follower of the Crown Prince.

25:39.890 --> 25:41.130
Whatever you want,

25:41.130 --> 25:42.680
I can give it to you.

25:43.500 --> 25:45.150
A martial arts master as you are,

25:45.170 --> 25:47.320
I can promise you a bright future.

25:47.340 --> 25:49.200
No matter what...

26:31.010 --> 26:31.770
Your Excellency,

26:31.770 --> 26:33.480
the Second Prince really thinks highly of you.

26:33.500 --> 26:34.440
Indeed.

26:34.460 --> 26:35.930
Are you unwilling

26:35.930 --> 26:37.650
to follow him?

26:38.100 --> 26:40.110
I've been to that alley when I was free.

26:40.130 --> 26:42.010
There were many street vendors

26:42.010 --> 26:43.840
and fried cake stands on the road.

26:43.860 --> 26:45.100
Today, they are all driven away

26:45.100 --> 26:46.840
simply because he wants to enjoy the cool.

26:46.860 --> 26:48.410
One day without income.

26:48.740 --> 26:50.480
What's wrong with that?

26:51.890 --> 26:53.890
If people are born with nobleness and lowliness,

26:54.290 --> 26:55.720
there's nothing wrong.

26:57.740 --> 26:58.960
Forget it.

26:59.340 --> 27:00.560
The Lin mansion is right ahead.

27:00.580 --> 27:02.680
Are you confident in finding Lin Gong?

27:02.820 --> 27:04.960
They just left today, so the impressions are new.

27:04.980 --> 27:05.620
Finding Lin Gong

27:05.620 --> 27:06.870
is as easy as winking.

27:06.890 --> 27:08.440
Your Excellency, come with me.

27:19.290 --> 27:21.010
The road is actually covered with flagstones!

27:22.170 --> 27:23.770
What's wrong with that?

27:25.380 --> 27:28.290
Then there wouldn't be any impressions.

27:34.740 --> 27:35.750
Your Excellency,

27:35.770 --> 27:37.680
there's still another way.

27:37.770 --> 27:39.630
Ling Gong left with many subordinates.

27:39.650 --> 27:41.110
Someone must have seen them.

27:41.130 --> 27:43.200
Let's inquire about them

27:43.220 --> 27:44.390
along the road.

27:44.410 --> 27:45.960
We might get some information.

27:46.010 --> 27:47.320
There's no time.

27:48.380 --> 27:50.080
We've wasted so much time,

27:50.890 --> 27:51.410
I'm afraid Lin Gong

27:51.410 --> 27:53.200
might have gone away.

28:37.020 --> 28:40.370
=Lin Gong and his guards have been
killed at the suburb of the capital city.=

28:46.740 --> 28:48.220
Your Excellency, where are we going?

28:48.220 --> 28:49.370
We're leaving the city.

29:17.050 --> 29:18.250
Find him.

29:29.250 --> 29:30.650
He's dead.

29:36.700 --> 29:38.480
Your Excellency, he's dead.

29:57.220 --> 29:58.600
Here he is!

30:06.740 --> 30:08.480
It's really Lin Gong.

30:14.930 --> 30:16.890
How do you get the information?

30:23.050 --> 30:23.740
It just appeared on my desk

30:23.740 --> 30:25.390
out of nowhere.

30:25.410 --> 30:27.170
I followed the lead

30:27.290 --> 30:28.770
and found him there.

30:29.770 --> 30:31.440
Have you got anything from the handwriting?

30:32.340 --> 30:34.800
The handwriting is too neat. It's hard to find any clue.

30:34.890 --> 30:36.720
I just don't get it.

30:36.740 --> 30:38.440
Lin Gong was killed.

30:38.460 --> 30:39.700
Why did the killer give us the address

30:39.700 --> 30:41.360
to collect the body?

30:41.380 --> 30:43.290
Judged from Lin Gong's wounds,

30:43.500 --> 30:44.680
they might be caused by sword.

30:44.700 --> 30:45.680
Then let's investigate

30:45.700 --> 30:46.220
the swordsmen who have been in and out of

30:46.220 --> 30:47.870
the capital city in recent days.

30:47.890 --> 30:50.600
The killer is highly skilled.

30:50.650 --> 30:52.150
Only one man is so good at sword

30:52.170 --> 30:54.270
both in and out of the capital city.

30:54.290 --> 30:55.600
Who is that?

30:59.340 --> 31:01.010
Xie Bi'an,

31:01.290 --> 31:02.800
the follower of the Second Prince.

31:04.740 --> 31:06.720
Lin Gong is the follower of the Crown Prince.

31:07.740 --> 31:09.230
Let's submit a secret memorial to the imperial palace,

31:09.250 --> 31:11.130
and let His Majesty make the call.

31:12.410 --> 31:13.960
It's the only way.

31:13.980 --> 31:17.080
The capital city will soon descend into chaos.

31:35.380 --> 31:36.600
Are you hungry?

31:37.890 --> 31:38.410
I've asked the kitchen cook

31:38.410 --> 31:40.010
to make the pastries for you.

31:40.050 --> 31:41.560
Take it as the midnight snack.

31:43.170 --> 31:44.510
You have something for me.

31:44.530 --> 31:45.840
No.

31:46.170 --> 31:47.680
Brother, don't get me wrong.

31:47.860 --> 31:48.380
I haven't seen you

31:48.380 --> 31:49.960
for days.

31:49.980 --> 31:51.320
I really miss you.

31:51.340 --> 31:53.770
You usually call me by my name.

31:56.620 --> 31:58.250
Brother, here is the thing.

31:58.700 --> 32:00.390
I've find a place for our shop.

32:00.410 --> 32:01.440
We'll employ servants

32:01.460 --> 32:02.680
from our mansion.

32:02.700 --> 32:03.600
So we can open the shop

32:03.620 --> 32:05.050
in just a few days.

32:05.620 --> 32:07.130
You still remember it?

32:07.410 --> 32:09.110
Of course, I do.

32:09.130 --> 32:10.170
It will make a huge profit.

32:10.170 --> 32:11.110
How can I forget?

32:11.130 --> 32:12.150
Brother,

32:12.170 --> 32:14.010
are you still writing the Red Mansions?

32:14.530 --> 32:16.050
How should we

32:16.050 --> 32:17.770
name the shop?

32:19.050 --> 32:20.720
Why do you look at me like that?

32:20.740 --> 32:22.480
Did I say anything wrong?

32:22.500 --> 32:23.130
Uncle...

32:23.130 --> 32:24.750
Right! The book.
('book' is a homophone for 'uncle' in Chinese)

32:24.770 --> 32:26.080
Just keep writing.

32:26.100 --> 32:27.410
Don't...

32:31.170 --> 32:34.130
He's fine. He just passed out.

32:46.100 --> 32:47.480
Tell me!

32:48.340 --> 32:50.530
After knocking me out last night,

32:50.620 --> 32:51.960
where did you go?

32:53.250 --> 32:53.930
Do you know that

32:53.930 --> 32:54.680
he might have ran away

32:54.700 --> 32:56.840
during that moment?

32:57.650 --> 32:59.030
I killed Lin Gong.

32:59.050 --> 33:00.440
I followed him out of the city

33:00.460 --> 33:01.840
and killed him.

33:02.460 --> 33:03.250
If you want to kill him,

33:03.250 --> 33:04.910
then why did you stop me last night?

33:04.930 --> 33:06.960
Because you were hesitant.

33:06.980 --> 33:08.030
You were utterly confused.

33:08.050 --> 33:10.170
Who gave you the right to kill him?

33:10.770 --> 33:12.110
Your mom did.

33:12.130 --> 33:13.530
If you can't make the call,

33:13.740 --> 33:14.720
I'll make it for you.

33:14.740 --> 33:15.410
You always say so.

33:15.410 --> 33:16.960
You were hesitant to kill him,

33:16.980 --> 33:18.320
so I would kill him for you.

33:18.340 --> 33:19.700
-You always say that! -Whoever wants to kill you,

33:19.700 --> 33:20.820
I'll kill him.

33:20.820 --> 33:22.770
You always say that!

33:23.460 --> 33:24.130
Then where were you

33:24.130 --> 33:25.130
when I was assassinated

33:25.130 --> 33:26.290
on the Niulan Street?

33:26.740 --> 33:28.130
Where were you

33:28.130 --> 33:29.680
when someone tried to kill me?

33:34.170 --> 33:35.650
I was not in the capital city

33:35.770 --> 33:37.370
when the assassination took place.

33:39.130 --> 33:40.530
I'm sorry.

33:41.930 --> 33:43.650
It won't happen again.

33:50.340 --> 33:52.200
Sir! Sir!

33:52.380 --> 33:53.650
Please show mercy!

33:57.050 --> 33:59.010
Thank you! Thank you!

33:59.530 --> 34:01.530
Thank you! Thank you!

34:23.580 --> 34:25.490
You're not in the capital city recently.

34:25.580 --> 34:27.170
Where have you been?

34:27.900 --> 34:29.280
I went to the Jiangnan area.

34:31.210 --> 34:32.970
Why did you go there?

34:34.010 --> 34:35.930
Do you still have your mom's box?

34:53.340 --> 34:53.900
I want to open the box

34:53.900 --> 34:55.690
left by your mom,

34:56.940 --> 34:59.240
but I can't remember the past clearly.

34:59.420 --> 35:01.520
I only remember that the key should be in the capital city,

35:02.660 --> 35:05.000
but I can't remember the exact place.

35:05.140 --> 35:06.230
If the key is in the capital city,

35:06.250 --> 35:07.890
why did you go to the Jiangnan area?

35:08.450 --> 35:10.000
I remember vaguely that

35:10.860 --> 35:12.360
your mom and I talked about the box

35:12.380 --> 35:14.320
in the Jiangnan area.

35:15.250 --> 35:17.370
So I revisited the places

35:17.530 --> 35:18.560
to see

35:18.580 --> 35:20.320
whether I can remember something or not.

35:21.420 --> 35:22.640
Have you got any clue?

35:22.660 --> 35:23.880
Yes.

35:23.900 --> 35:25.130
Now I've confirmed that

35:25.730 --> 35:27.190
the key to the box

35:27.210 --> 35:28.400
might be kept in two places.

35:28.420 --> 35:30.280
It might be kept in the palace.

35:30.820 --> 35:31.670
The imperial palace?

35:31.690 --> 35:32.880
Right.

35:32.900 --> 35:35.600
We can search for it if we have time.

35:36.620 --> 35:37.920
Uncle,

35:37.940 --> 35:39.340
the imperial palace is filled with martial arts masters.

35:39.340 --> 35:40.400
And you said yourself that

35:40.420 --> 35:41.970
one of the Four Great Masters

35:41.970 --> 35:43.180
might be there.

35:43.180 --> 35:44.140
If we don't know

35:44.140 --> 35:45.650
who he really is,

35:45.730 --> 35:46.880
it might be dangerous.

35:46.900 --> 35:48.230
If he's really in the imperial palace,

35:48.250 --> 35:49.320
he might be that old eunuch

35:49.340 --> 35:50.840
surnamed Hong.

35:50.860 --> 35:52.320
Hong Sixiang?

35:53.860 --> 35:54.840
Can we sneak into the imperial palace

35:54.860 --> 35:56.120
without being noticed by him?

35:56.140 --> 35:59.130
Probably not. We have to break in.

36:00.530 --> 36:01.750
Then tell me

36:01.770 --> 36:03.160
the other place.

36:03.180 --> 36:04.370
The key

36:05.010 --> 36:05.530
might be kept

36:05.530 --> 36:07.320
where your mom once lived.

36:07.940 --> 36:09.030
Does it have a name?

36:09.050 --> 36:10.160
Taiping Residence.

36:10.180 --> 36:10.770
Where is it?

36:10.770 --> 36:11.620
Somewhere near the capital city.

36:11.620 --> 36:12.880
What's the exact location?

36:12.900 --> 36:14.210
I can't remember.

36:15.530 --> 36:16.800
Help me find it.

36:21.970 --> 36:23.120
OK.

36:23.140 --> 36:25.650
I have to ask my father.

36:31.490 --> 36:32.670
Don't let Fan Jian know I'm back.

36:32.690 --> 36:33.800
OK.

36:34.690 --> 36:35.950
That's all for now.

36:35.970 --> 36:37.730
Find the Taiping Residence as soon as possible.

36:38.250 --> 36:40.280
I'll stay in the capital city these days.

36:41.580 --> 36:42.970
Where are you staying?

36:45.490 --> 36:46.650
Uncle?

36:48.340 --> 36:49.600
Uncle?

36:55.940 --> 36:57.210
Uncle,

36:57.620 --> 36:59.890
next time you leave,

37:00.580 --> 37:02.280
just let me know.

37:05.290 --> 37:06.450
Fine.

37:51.140 --> 37:52.320
Sister.

38:10.210 --> 38:11.520
Why did I sleep on the floor

38:11.660 --> 38:12.660
of your room

38:12.660 --> 38:14.160
last night?

38:14.180 --> 38:15.840
I don't know.

38:16.210 --> 38:17.660
Do you know

38:17.660 --> 38:19.800
I came to see you last night?

38:20.250 --> 38:21.690
I don't remember.

38:24.690 --> 38:26.450
Is our mansion haunted?

38:34.690 --> 38:36.000
Come to my study.

38:42.820 --> 38:43.420
Who?

38:43.420 --> 38:44.800
Me.

38:47.660 --> 38:49.370
I also finished eating.

38:56.380 --> 38:57.050
Mom,

38:57.050 --> 38:57.920
since Fan Xian

38:57.940 --> 38:59.760
came to our mansion,

39:00.770 --> 39:01.580
Dad seldom

39:01.580 --> 39:03.130
finds fault with me.

39:03.490 --> 39:04.340
He has nothing to say to you.

39:04.340 --> 39:05.970
It's not a good thing.

39:06.900 --> 39:08.280
Mom,

39:09.140 --> 39:10.250
this is not what we should

39:10.250 --> 39:11.970
be worried about now.

39:13.660 --> 39:16.560
What we should be worried about the most

39:17.050 --> 39:19.410
is that our mansion is haunted.

39:21.010 --> 39:22.380
Oh my God!

39:22.380 --> 39:24.410
How come I have such a son?!

39:33.250 --> 39:34.600
Brother.

39:37.620 --> 39:39.000
Lin Gong is dead.

39:41.250 --> 39:42.690
How did you do it?

39:44.530 --> 39:45.640
I didn't.

39:45.660 --> 39:47.370
Whatever,

39:48.530 --> 39:49.890
just handle it cautiously.

40:10.660 --> 40:12.080
Lin Gong is dead.

40:12.530 --> 40:13.890
Really?

40:14.010 --> 40:15.840
It was discovered by the Investigator's Office.

40:15.860 --> 40:17.010
He died in a desolated yard

40:17.010 --> 40:18.470
in the suburb yesterday.

40:18.490 --> 40:21.840
The killer might be a sword master.

40:21.860 --> 40:23.450
How could it happen?!

40:24.860 --> 40:26.410
Have they found the killer?

40:27.660 --> 40:30.520
Is Wuzhu back?

40:31.100 --> 40:32.800
I haven't seen him for a long time.

40:35.380 --> 40:37.280
Is Uncle Wuzhu involved?

40:44.860 --> 40:46.520
I'm just asking.

40:47.340 --> 40:48.650
You can leave.

40:57.970 --> 40:59.760
Do you know Taiping Residence?

41:00.210 --> 41:01.640
Why do you ask?

41:01.660 --> 41:02.600
I heard that

41:02.620 --> 41:04.270
my mom used to live there.

41:04.290 --> 41:05.230
Yes.

41:05.250 --> 41:06.430
I want to visit her past residence

41:06.450 --> 41:07.600
to mourn for her.

41:07.620 --> 41:08.470
You can't go there.

41:08.490 --> 41:09.190
Why?

41:09.210 --> 41:10.320
I told you that

41:10.420 --> 41:11.490
your mom's identity

41:11.490 --> 41:12.600
must remain a secret.

41:12.620 --> 41:13.640
I will keep a distance.

41:13.660 --> 41:14.800
No way.

41:18.250 --> 41:19.990
You'll have to wait

41:20.010 --> 41:21.180
till you inherit the Neiku.

41:21.180 --> 41:21.730
Father.

41:21.730 --> 41:23.560
Say no more.

41:27.820 --> 41:29.450
Then I'll see myself out.

41:36.140 --> 41:37.410
Brother.

41:39.250 --> 41:41.030
Brother. Brother. Brother.

41:41.050 --> 41:42.750
Have you thought of a name?

41:42.770 --> 41:44.030
What name?

41:44.050 --> 41:45.510
A name for our business.

41:45.530 --> 41:46.840
For our bookstore?

41:47.140 --> 41:48.160
Let's call it Danbo Bookstore.

41:48.180 --> 41:48.900
Danbo?

41:48.900 --> 41:50.320
There's an allusion to it.

41:50.340 --> 41:51.560
Only by remaining indifferent to fame
and fortune can one show his high ideals.

41:51.580 --> 41:52.530
Fine. Fine. Fine.

41:52.530 --> 41:53.230
It doesn't matter.

41:53.250 --> 41:54.840
Illusion or not, that's not important.

41:54.860 --> 41:56.530
The most urgent task for you

41:56.530 --> 41:58.230
is to write your book.

41:58.250 --> 41:59.620
When our bookstore opens,

41:59.620 --> 42:00.620
its future and prospect

42:00.620 --> 42:01.820
all counts on you.

42:01.820 --> 42:03.100
Don't engage yourself in all the social activities.

42:03.100 --> 42:04.010
Young Master Fan Xian,

42:04.010 --> 42:05.690
the Crown Prince has the door blocked

42:05.690 --> 42:07.160
and orders to see you in the Eastern Palace.

42:07.180 --> 42:08.450
The Crown Prince?

42:08.580 --> 42:09.450
Young Master Fan Xian,

42:09.450 --> 42:10.210
the sedan of the Prime Minister's mansion

42:10.210 --> 42:11.250
has arrived at the door.

42:11.250 --> 42:12.430
The Prime Minister wants to see you.

42:12.450 --> 42:13.320
Lin Ruofu?

42:13.340 --> 42:14.710
Can they just let him write his book?

42:14.730 --> 42:15.810
Get lost!

42:18.730 --> 42:19.880
Just leave us.

42:19.900 --> 42:21.170
Yes.

42:24.900 --> 42:28.920
It must be for Lin Gong's death.

42:28.940 --> 42:30.800
I have nothing to do with that.

42:30.820 --> 42:31.880
Why do they want to see me?

42:31.900 --> 42:33.210
I'm afraid

42:33.380 --> 42:35.560
you'll figure that out after seeing them.

42:36.210 --> 42:38.040
Then who should I see first?

42:39.770 --> 42:42.040
Prime Minister Lin Ruofu

42:42.580 --> 42:45.160
and the Crown Prince are not on the same side.

42:45.180 --> 42:46.600
Whoever you choose to see first,

42:46.620 --> 42:48.240
you'll offend the other one.

42:49.490 --> 42:50.430
Young Master Fan Xian,

42:50.450 --> 42:51.510
the imperial guards are here.

42:51.530 --> 42:53.650
His Majesty ordered to see you
through a verbal instruction.

42:53.860 --> 42:55.650
Now you don't have to choose.

43:21.600 --> 43:25.180
In the river of history,

43:25.200 --> 43:28.670
time goes round and round.

43:31.480 --> 43:34.820
Memories about the former and present lives

43:34.840 --> 43:38.910
join each other in an endless way.

43:40.800 --> 43:43.420
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:43.440 --> 43:45.680
one season follows another in a flash,

43:45.680 --> 43:48.180
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:48.200 --> 43:49.800
I just can't give up

43:49.800 --> 43:53.140
to be with you for my whole life.

43:53.160 --> 43:58.630
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:59.880 --> 44:02.430
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

44:02.720 --> 44:04.760
Year after year in the wandering,

44:04.760 --> 44:07.420
I count the remaining years.

44:07.440 --> 44:09.620
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:09.640 --> 44:11.630
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:11.920 --> 44:14.310
I never feel regretful.

44:14.360 --> 44:15.720
In such a chaotic world,

44:15.720 --> 44:18.700
I still miss you as ever.

44:18.720 --> 44:21.670
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:21.960 --> 44:24.020
With a gentle heart,

44:24.040 --> 44:26.700
I cherish our remaining years.

44:26.720 --> 44:28.240
Even though we have to go through

44:28.240 --> 44:30.750
all the hardships along the journey,

44:30.880 --> 44:38.070
you always stay by my side,

44:38.160 --> 44:40.830
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:41.120 --> 44:43.200
Year after year in the wandering,

44:43.200 --> 44:45.860
I count the remaining years.

44:45.880 --> 44:48.020
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:48.040 --> 44:50.270
even though we end up the destiny,

44:50.480 --> 44:52.660
I never feel regretful.

44:52.680 --> 44:54.080
In such a chaotic world,

44:54.080 --> 44:57.140
I still miss you as ever.

44:57.160 --> 45:00.270
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

45:00.360 --> 45:02.500
With a gentle heart,

45:02.520 --> 45:05.220
I cherish our remaining years.

45:05.240 --> 45:06.680
Even though we have to go through

45:06.680 --> 45:09.340
all the hardships along the journey,

45:09.360 --> 45:18.120
you always stay by my side...
